  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3309.04 State Labels. Each modular building or building component that is approved pursuant to RSA 205-C and these rules shall have a state label permanently attached in a visible location that cannot be removed without destroying the label.\n\nSource. #5439, eff 7-24-92; amd by #5935, eff 12-20-94; ss by #6810, INTERIM, eff 7-25-98, EXPIRES: 11-22-98; ss by #6885, eff 11-18-98; ss by #8741, INTERIM, eff 11-18-06, EXPIRED: 5-17-07\n\nNew. #9752, eff 7-9-10; ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
